  "created_at": "2025-12-23T10:18:26-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Margaret Peckham",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T10:16:55-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T10:16:59-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yeah, I'm calling about a puddle at 443 Old Beach Road, the Easton's Beach side, and it's across half the road and it has not rained since Monday, I mean not a drop, and it's still just sitting there, so something's clearly clogged or not draining, and I've driven through it twice now and I'm sick of swerving around it, I took photos too if you want them."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T10:17:19-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so that's 443 Old Beach Road, a puddle across about half the road, and no rain since Monday. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T10:17:26-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, exactly. [line breaks up] ...the drain on the corner, I think."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T10:17:30-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm sorry, you broke up on me there. Which drain did you say?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T10:17:35-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The storm drain right by the corner there, near my house. Water just sits. Can I send the photos somewhere?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T10:17:42-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I can give you an address for those, and I'll note that you have them. Let me put the report in first."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T10:17:49-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Will there be a work order opened? And for what date? Because I'd like an actual date, not just a maybe."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T10:17:56-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm opening a work order now. I can't see a scheduled date yet, since a crew has to look at it first. Once it's assigned, they'll have a date. What's a good number for you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T10:18:07-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0181. Sorry, my cell's bad here. I'm also stuck at home sorting stuff out because my passport expired and I haven't renewed it yet, so I'm around."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T10:18:15-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 401-555-0181. I've got the number and the address. Someone from the office will call you with the work order date."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T10:18:22-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright, thanks."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T10:18:24-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Happy holidays."
    }
  ],
